  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/banner/header_paperdoll.png\" alt=\"纸娃娃横幅\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/caVV5eXekm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/social_buttons_icon/Discord-Button-64.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/tr7zw/PaperDoll\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/social_buttons_icon/Github-Button-64.png\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpaperdoll\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/social_buttons_icon/Modrinth-Button-64.png\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/paperdoll\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/social_buttons_icon/Curseforge-Button-64.png\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ftr7zw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/social_buttons_icon/Kofi-Button-64.png\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a>\n</p><p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/divider_faded/Divider_04.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p><p><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/headlines/large/About.png\" alt=\"关于\"><br></p><p>PaperDoll是一款客户端模组，可在UI中添加基岩版风格的纸娃娃形象。它具有高度可定制性，通过提供更具沉浸感的角色视角来增强游戏体验。</p><p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/divider_faded/Divider_04.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p><p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/headlines/large/Features.png\" alt=\"功能特色\"></p><h3>丰富功能</h3><ul>\n<li>支持观察其他实体</li>\n<li>船只等载具及其乘客会完整显示</li>\n<li>与Essential、Wavey Capes、3d Skin Layers等模组高度兼容</li>\n</ul><h3>高度自定义</h3><ul>\n<li>自由调整纸娃娃位置与大小</li>\n<li>可完全配置显示逻辑，仅在特定动作时显示纸娃娃</li>\n<li>多种视角行为模式</li>\n</ul><p><br></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252fx%252ftr7zw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/banner/essential_1.png\" alt=\"Essential\"></a><br><br></p><p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/divider_faded/Divider_04.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p><p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/headlines/medium/Compatibility &amp; Dependancys.png\" alt=\"兼容性与依赖\"></p><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Minecraft版本</th>\n<th>加载器</th>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>版本</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1.16.5+</td>\n<td>Fabric/Forge<em>/NeoForge</em></td>\n<td>✅ 支持</td>\n<td>最新版</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>*1.21.6/7</td>\n<td>NeoForge</td>\n<td>❌ 不支持</td>\n<td>不可用</td>\n<td>NeoForge因故对原版逻辑进行了重大不兼容修改，导致模组无法运行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>*1.16.5</td>\n<td>Forge</td>\n<td>⚠️ 停止支持</td>\n<td>旧版</td>\n<td>在支持JarInJar模组格式前将不再维护</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/divider_faded/Divider_04.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p><p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/headlines/medium/Screenshots Media.png\" alt=\"截图与演示\"></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/tr7zw/PaperDoll/raw/1.18/screenshots/boats.png\" alt=\"纸娃娃示例\"></p><p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/divider_faded/Divider_04.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p><p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/headlines/medium/Known Issues.png\" alt=\"已知问题\"></p><ul>\n<li>部分坐骑显示异常</li>\n<li>不支持发光效果</li>\n<li>详细动画存在方向判定问题</li>\n<li>骑马跳跃时的偏移量不准确</li>\n</ul><p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/divider_faded/Divider_04.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p><p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/headlines/medium/FAQ.png\" alt=\"常见问题\"></p><h3>需要在服务器安装吗？</h3><p>不需要。这是纯客户端模组，<strong>无需</strong>在服务器端安装。</p><p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/divider_faded/Divider_04.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p><p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/headlines/medium/Credits &amp; License.png\" alt=\"致谢与许可\"></p><p>👤 感谢Github上优秀的翻译者与贡献者们！\n<a href=\"https://github.com/tr7zw/PaperDoll/graphs/contributors\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/links/underlined/more_details.png\" alt=\"详情链接\">\n</a> <br><br>\n📄 许可证：tr7zw保护性许可证 <br>\n允许在Modrinth/Curseforge托管的整合包中自由使用本模组（无需申请授权）。禁止在其他任何地方重新分发jar文件！</p>",
